# fixedbugs, defect 152, lane ffi-macro, 2026-10-02.
#
# SYMPTOM: `function stdin() -> ptr` under `extern "stdio.h"` was `internal
# error`, exit 2: *called object type 'FILE *'*. `stdin` is a `FILE *`
# object on every libc, behind a macro on two of them.
#
# CAUSE AND FIX: as `fixedbugs-152-an-object-declared-as-a-function`; the
# object's type is written into the suggested function as the header spells
# it, pointer and all.

extern "stdio.h"
    function stdin() -> ptr  #~ ffi_call_shape

function main()
    print(stdin() == nullptr)
